{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261112%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E4%B8%80%E7%94%B7%E4%B8%80%E5%A5%B3%E5%A0%B1%E7%A8%B1%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%B0%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%AB-%E6%B6%89%E6%96%BC%E6%9D%B1%E5%8D%80%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%BA%AD%E5%85%A7%E6%8B%8D%E6%94%9D%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A7-%E5%87%865000%E5%85%83%E4%BF%9D%E9%87%8B%E8%87%B312.23%E5%86%8D%E8%A8%8A-819x1024.png\" width=\"819\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>報稱內地律師的一男一女昨涉於東區裁判法院庭內拍攝，各被控一項「禁止在法院處所內作出記錄等」罪，案件今（12日）在東區裁判法院首度提堂，兩人暫毋須答辯，案件押後至12月23日，待控方索取法律意見，以考慮控罪的適合性。兩人分別獲准以5,000元保釋外出。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>兩名被告依次為杨程（男，30歲）、王杨（女，38歲），均報稱內地律師，兩人持雙程證，居於內地。</p>\n<p>兩人各被控一項「禁止在法院處所內作出記錄等」罪，涉於今年11月11日，在東區裁判法院9號庭，無合法權限而故意記錄法院處所及身處法院住所的人。</p>\n<p>法院：東區裁判法院<br/>被告：杨程、王杨<br/>控罪：禁止在法院處所內作出記錄等<br/>案件編號：ESCC2650/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:03:51.905701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:28:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:37:10.591185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:57:13.807572+00:00","content_hash":"48046bd5a69f28e24bf2bf105f7ac1fe219ee52b025a6ec47fb22c3069fc7090","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}